        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MP9116, Large Edge Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Modern Edge Cabinet Pull has a small profile, making it ideal for modern kitchen remodels. This cabinet pull can be mounted vertically or horizontally with the included hardware to accommodate both kitchen cabinet doors and drawers. This Large Hidden Cabinet Pull is 9-1/16 inches long with 6-5/16 inch mounting centers. It is available in polished chrome, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP9116-Specifications.gif?v=1704354780\" width=\"600\" height=\"253\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MP9116 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/2-15-16-inch-modern-hidden-cabinet-pull-deltana-mp21516\"><b>Deltana MP21516 Small Edge Cabinet Pull</b></a> and\r\n<a href=\"/products/medium-modern-hidden-cabinet-pull-deltana-mp578\"><b>Deltana MP578 Medium Edge Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP9116-installed.jpg?v=1704352953\" width=\"271\" height=\"264\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana MP9116 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Length:  9-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP9116-specifications.pdf?v=1704262341\"><b>Deltana MP9116 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
