                "title": "Large Modern Hidden Cabinet Pull",
                "description": "The Large Modern Edge Cabinet Pull has a small profile, making it ideal for modern kitchen remodels. The mirror pull can be mounted vertically or horizontally with the included hardware to accommodate both kitchen cabinet doors and drawers. This Large Edge Cabinet Pull is 9-1/16 inches long with 6-5/16 inch mounting centers. It is available in polished chrome, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes.",
